+## README library-only installation option may no longer work with…
+
+This section addresses the following contribution task:
+
+- README library-only installation option may no longer work with current packaging
+
+The README documents setting `TABULATE_INSTALL=lib-only` when installing `tabulate` so that only the Python library is installed.
+- It gives commands for Unix-like systems and Windows.
+- However, the repository's current `pyproject.toml` uses `flit_scm:buildapi` and declares a console entry point unconditionally:
+
+```toml
+[project.scripts]
+tabulate = "tabulate.cli:_main"
+```
+
+I could not find a corresponding setting in the current packaging configuration that uses `TABULATE_INSTALL` to disable this entry point.
+- The README option may be left over from a previous build system.
+
